  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Country Programme 2016-2020. PRLHR Thematic Programme: Peace, Rule of Law and Human Rights</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Peace, rule of law and human rights promoted. Supported a fair and inclusive peace and reconciliation process as a contribution to, as well as a precondition for, the future development of Myanmar as a democratic and peaceful society.  And enhanced the application of and respect for international human rights standards and rule of law in Myanmar&#x2019;s justice system.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">There are several transactions in 2023, that do not require reporting. One relates to reimbursements of activity costs undertaken and reported on in 2022. Other transactions include Danida Advisor costs, audit fee and return of unspent funds and interests.</narrative>
  </description>
